EDEC2 0 38 5 0 0.5
DOP 51 25 MDTH 400E-12
VOP 4 25 1.474575E+00
DON 24 52 MDTH 400E-12
VON 24 5 1.474575E+00
RAJUS 50 5 1E12
GCOMP 5 4 4 5 8.1566068E-04
RPM1 5 80 1E+06
